+> **Description:** NeuralProphet is a simple forecasting package that extends the Prophet-style workflow with autoregression, neural components, lagged regressors, future regressors, events, uncertainty, and global modeling. That makes it attractive in ecommerce when standard trend and seasonality models are not enough, but teams still want something far easier to manage than a fully custom forecasting stack. GitHub showed **4.3k stars**, **Python** as the primary language, an **MIT** license, and active visible releases through **Jun 2024**. It is a good middle ground between classic business forecasting and deep learning flexibility.
