+### Search, Retrieval, And Product Discovery
+
+#### [OpenSearch](https://github.com/opensearch-project/OpenSearch)
+> **Description:** OpenSearch describes itself as an open-source, enterprise-grade search and observability suite that brings order to unstructured data at scale. For ecommerce teams, that translates into faceted product search, ranking controls, analyzers, filters, and operational maturity for large catalogs. It is Apache-2.0 licensed and remains highly active on GitHub. GitHub metadata at review time showed **12.7k stars**, **Java** as the primary language, and a recent commit on **Mar 9, 2026**. Best fit when you need heavy-duty indexing, custom search pipelines, and a broader ecosystem around distributed search infrastructure.
