+> **Description:** Stable Diffusion WebUI is a Gradio-based web interface for Stable Diffusion with txt2img, img2img, inpainting, outpainting, upscaling, prompt editing, extensions, API access, and a large plugin ecosystem. For ecommerce, it is useful when internal teams want a flexible self-hosted studio for product imagery, campaign mockups, and creative experimentation. The repo is licensed **AGPL-3.0**, primarily written in **Python**, and remains one of the most widely used open image-generation UIs on GitHub. It is feature-rich, but more operationally messy than newer workflow-first tools like ComfyUI.
