+### Forecasting, Demand Planning, And Operations
+
+`Gap note:` Only 4 repos met the bar here without slipping into generic MLOps or non-AI workflow tooling. That shortfall is real and worth acknowledging.
+
+#### [Prophet](https://github.com/facebook/prophet)
+> **Description:** Prophet is built for producing high-quality forecasts for time series data with multiple seasonality and linear or non-linear growth. In ecommerce, that maps directly to demand planning, promotion lift analysis, traffic forecasting, staffing estimates, and inventory-aware merchandising. GitHub showed **20.1k stars**, **Python** as the primary language, an **MIT** license, and active releases through **Jan 2026**. It remains one of the best open starting points when business teams need interpretable forecasting rather than a fully custom deep learning pipeline.
+
