+#### [GluonTS](https://github.com/awslabs/gluonts)
+> **Description:** GluonTS is a probabilistic time series modeling library in Python with strong support for neural forecasting and uncertainty-aware prediction. In ecommerce, that is valuable for replenishment, promotion planning, and scenario modeling where intervals matter as much as point forecasts. GitHub showed **5.2k stars**, **Python** as the primary language, an **Apache-2.0** license, and active releases through **Jun 2025**. It is a stronger choice than Prophet when you need probabilistic forecasts, multi-series modeling, or deeper experimentation with modern neural approaches.
