+#### [Vespa](https://github.com/vespa-engine/vespa)
+> **Description:** Vespa’s README centers on serving AI and data online with support for search, vectors, tensors, and recommendation serving. That combination is particularly useful in ecommerce when retrieval, ranking, and personalization need to happen in one low-latency system. On GitHub, Vespa showed **6.8k stars**, **Java** as the primary language, and an **Apache-2.0** license. Its repo and releases were active into **Mar 2026**, and it remains one of the strongest open platforms for advanced retrieval plus ranking pipelines. Use it when catalog size, relevance logic, or real-time ranking complexity exceed simpler search engines.
+
