+### Recommendations And Personalization
+
+#### [Metarank](https://github.com/metarank/metarank)
+> **Description:** Metarank calls itself a low-code machine learning personalized ranking service for listings, search results, and recommendations. That scope maps cleanly to ecommerce ranking problems like click-through optimization, re-ranking category pages, and personalizing search output from behavioral signals. GitHub showed **2.4k stars**, **Apache-2.0** licensing, and a latest visible commit on **Sep 24, 2025**. The repository is primarily Scala-based and exposes ranking-oriented workflows rather than just offline notebooks, which makes it more practical than many academic recommender repos when you need a deployable personalization layer.
