+#### [Rasa](https://github.com/RasaHQ/rasa)
+> **Description:** Rasa is an open source machine learning framework for automating text- and voice-based conversations, with support for multiple channels and contextual back-and-forth. For ecommerce, it is useful for order support, returns flows, pre-purchase Q&A, and custom assistant logic where you do not want to hand core interactions to a black-box vendor. GitHub showed **21.1k stars**, **Python** as the primary language, an **Apache-2.0** license, and a latest visible commit on **Nov 25, 2024**. The repo is in maintenance mode, but it remains one of the most mature open GitHub foundations for controlled conversational systems.
